^["stream"]{
 >>[2026-03-25 00:18] observe — prompt-pack files parse structurally but still emit lexer errors on `+` inside `%[...]` formulas.
 >>[2026-03-25 00:19] observe — prompt header anchors use `##>name`, but LSP and plugin annotation scanners only treat `#>name` as first-class anchor syntax.
 >>[2026-03-25 00:20] hygiene — base ref recorded from main@737751435d515b93c4e39963b58fe2373070fa8b; `main...HEAD` has no unrelated drift outside plan artifacts.
 >>[2026-03-25 00:21] decide — keep parser work narrow: eliminate prompt-surface false positives without redefining the language as a general arithmetic grammar.
 >>[2026-03-25 00:22] taste — prompt syntax already exists socially in the repo; the tools need to respect that social contract.
